    description: "Observed in session_retrospective_04172026_1012.md Finding 1: the agent scanned only the top of tracker ready (the P2s), pattern-matched 'all remaining = multi-hour', and declared the backlog unworkable. P3/P4 ready items (WI-hogun, WI-sijoh, WI-tijim, WI-dajul, WI-jujup) were never considered, and the entire DEEP-mode priority queue (bakeoff cycle/aggregate/compare/dogfood/audits) was ignored.\n\nProposed AGENTS.md / stop_reflect.md change: require the agent to enumerate, before any 'no bounded work available' conclusion, (1) every ready item at every priority level it evaluated and why it was rejected, (2) each DEEP-mode priority-queue action (bakeoff cycle, aggregate, compare, dogfood, changelog audit, process-health audit) and why it was rejected, and (3) each unread human message and why a reply is not possible now. If any bucket is unchecked, the claim is invalid.\n\nGovernance file: touches AGENTS.md + .agent/stop_reflect.md -> needs_human_review."  # 0029
    fields: {}  # 0029
